  // ── Cracked variants (slightly less yield — Design Doc §2.2) ─────────────
  // Cracked stone has been weakened by stress, so it produces less waste rock.
  // These use wildcards to catch all rock type variants of cracked stone.
  // The wildcard entry does not override individual entries above (exact wins).

